    - destruct (NEWL a na La'); lia.
    - exact (FieldsC_ls_sep _ _ _ _ _ _ _ FC a b na nb La' Lb' NE). }
  intros a na La. destruct (CASE a na La) as [->|La']; [lia|].
  destruct (FieldsC_lnode_cases _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ FC La') as [->|(da & Lda & _ & P & _ & R)]; [lia|]. pose proof (esize_ge da). lia.
Qed.


